WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.497
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Strong Passwords and Scam Safety.

2
00:00:06.797 --> 00:00:11.760
Protect your accounts and avoid online scams. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:25.055
Step one. Make a strong password. Use twelve or more characters with words, numbers and symbols. Do not use 12345678.

4
00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:33.561
Step two. Turn on two-step login. After your password, a code is sent to your phone. Only you should see that code.

5
00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:41.083
Step three. Learn to spot a scam. Scams use urgent words, big prizes and strange links.

6
00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:49.882
Step four. Never share your password or your code with anyone. Delete the message, and ask a trusted person if you are not sure.

7
00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:55.242
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:55.542 --> 00:00:58.285
Change one weak password to a strong one.

9
00:00:58.585 --> 00:01:01.223
Turn on 2-step login on your email.

10
00:01:01.523 --> 00:01:04.219
Look at a message you got and find the warning signs.

11
00:01:04.519 --> 00:01:05.590
Well done!

